{"id": "nqa-S-7", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The document states that during the years Sir Jules de Vac served as master of fence at the English Court, \"the sons of royalty had learned to thrust and parry and cut as only De Vac could teach the art, and he had been as conscientious in the discharge of his duties as he had been in his unswerving hatred and contempt for his pupils.\"", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81482, "output_tokens": 89, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 16011, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.111, "judge": "incorrect", "correct": false, "judge_score": 0.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-8", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The story is set in \"the thirteenth century\" on \"this June day in the year of our Lord 1243\".", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81480, "output_tokens": 44, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 13319, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.167, "judge": "correct", "correct": true, "judge_score": 1.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-9", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "At age 19, Norman is leading a clan of outlaws.", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81484, "output_tokens": 31, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 4873, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.0, "judge": "correct", "correct": true, "judge_score": 1.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-10", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The document states that the events took place \"in the thirteenth century,\" and that it all started \"on this June day in the year of our Lord 1243.\"", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81480, "output_tokens": 53, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 31722, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.0, "judge": "incorrect", "correct": false, "judge_score": 0.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-11", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "By the time Norman is 17, he has become \"a very strong and straight and handsome lad. Bronzed and hardy from his outdoor life; of few words, for there was none that he might talk with save the taciturn old man; hating the English, for that he was taught as thoroughly as swordsmanship; speaking French fluently and English poorly\u2014and waiting impatiently for the day when the old man should send him out into the world with clanking armor and lance and shield to do battle with the knights of England.\"", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81485, "output_tokens": 125, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 26320, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.06, "judge": "partially_correct", "correct": false, "judge_score": 0.5}
{"id": "nqa-S-12", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The document states that he was raised by De Vac, who taught him three subjects: \"French, swordsmanship and hatred of all things English, especially the reigning house of England.\"", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81479, "output_tokens": 53, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 6661, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.222, "judge": "correct", "correct": true, "judge_score": 1.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-13", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The document does not say.", "abstained": true, "input_tokens": 81490, "output_tokens": 22, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 8542, "false_abstention": true, "correct": false, "judge_score": 0.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-14", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The story is set in the thirteenth century, with the events starting \"in the London palace of Henry III\" and later moving to other locations such as Derby and London.", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81482, "output_tokens": 50, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 51251, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.1, "judge": "correct", "correct": true, "judge_score": 1.0}
{"id": "nqa-S-15", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "De Vac was born in Paris, the son of a French officer reputed the best swordsman in France.", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81481, "output_tokens": 37, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 4952, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.0, "judge": "partially_correct", "correct": false, "judge_score": 0.5}
{"id": "nqa-S-16", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "The document states that Norman's father was a \"French officer reputed the best swordsman in France.\"", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81484, "output_tokens": 38, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 8654, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.0, "judge": "correct", "correct": true, "judge_score": 1.0}
