{"id": "nqa-S-18", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "Father Claude taught Norman to \"read and write in French, English and Latin\", to \"respect the rights of others, to espouse the cause of the poor and weak, to revere God and to believe that the principal reason for man\u2019s existence was to protect woman.\"", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81485, "output_tokens": 73, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 6188, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.0, "judge": "correct", "correct": true, "judge_score": 1.0}
