{"id": "nqa-S-20", "kind": "narrativeqa", "answerable": true, "depth": null, "build_seconds": 0.0, "answer": "When they find out he is not really dead, the court turns to stone and they institute a search that lasts over twenty years. The text states: \"the first fruits of it turned the hearts of the court of stone... Nowhere was there a sign or trace of Prince Richard... a search which did not end for over twenty years\".", "abstained": false, "input_tokens": 81488, "output_tokens": 84, "cost_usd": 0.0, "llm_ms": 5848, "false_abstention": false, "answer_f1": 0.045, "judge": "incorrect", "correct": false, "judge_score": 0.0}
